WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.600
It's easy to think breathing just keeps you alive.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.900
Before the exam,

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.900
before the hard conversation,

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.900
at 3 a.m., when nothing else is working,

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:22.900
in the corridor, waiting for news,

6
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.800
we all do the same thing. Nobody taught us.

7
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.600
Every time you breathe out, your heart slows down a little.

8
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.800
It's a brake you've carried your whole life.

9
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.900
You've been using it since your first birthday candle.

10
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.800
You just never knew it was there.

11
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.600
Breathing isn't just keeping you alive.

12
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
It's how you come back.

13
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.000
Try it now: breathe out slower than you breathe in.
